{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Return an `HrTime` instead of an ambiguous numeric `TimeInput`.** OpenTelemetry interprets a number below `otperformance.timeOrigin` as a relative `performance.now()` value. After a backward wall-clock adjustment makes this epoch-millisecond result precede the process origin, OpenTelemetry adds `timeOrigin` again, placing spans far in the future and breaking parent/child timing. Convert the computed value with `millisToHrTime` before passing it to span APIs.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74p7zN","finding_digest":"7cbd708ff7daf21b11c225bfdf7fb6685cc9b34861581cf0ea33789ad816737e","finding_id":"arf_v1_ps6xbd7x3lzbweocew75675wnb","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::livetimestamp::numeric-timeinput-origin-ambiguity","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts::livetimestamp::numeric-timeinput-origin-ambiguity","line":401,"observation_digest":"97727782534c94b08bddda27e7ab90eb62d1635cde958a4ac41a5e922e465bd4","observation_id":"aro_v1_s5zhpastjsklbc653it6pk4q5n","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/invocation-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T04:49:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tufo6iapkqwnrtmsyzpbh5cg42","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"a1a23f748ca05936085ee237b1bb7f9bb2883f2d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":401,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":960},"record_id":"art_v1_hukzxyj2ofa7tj6cj5wcxtlefa","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T04:49:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
